# Full runtime set: core plus the FinBERT stack. Only the transcript-sentiment
# workflow runs FinBERT, but validation/reproducibility.py records torch and
# transformers versions in the run manifest, so every production job installs
# them -- dropping them would change the manifest to "not-installed" and with it
# the reproducibility hash.
-r requirements-core.in

